    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNew Release Launching Early Autumn - Register Your Interest Today!\n\nGlenbrook marks the next chapter in Castlethorn's successful track record of delivering high-quality homes, building on the established communities of Ballymakenny Park and Usher's Mill in Drogheda, County Louth.\n\nRenowned for their exceptional craftsmanship, Castlethorn presents a selection of beautifully designed 3 and 4-bedroom family homes. Each property offers generous living space, stylish interiors, and a superior finish throughout. Designed with modern living in mind, all homes achieve a minimum A-rating on the BER scale, ensuring excellent energy efficiency.\n\nThe majority of homes will qualify for the Help to Buy.\n\nIdeally positioned on the edge of Drogheda town centre, the development enjoys convenient access to a wide range of nearby amenities, including the M1 Retail Park, Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital, local schools, shops, restaurants, and a selection of excellent golf clubs. Some of the finest beaches along the east coast are also within easy reach, making this location attractive to a broad range of buyers.\n\nBallymakenny Park also benefits from excellent connectivity, with the M1 motorway just a short drive away via the newly opened Port Access Northern Cross Route (PANCR), ensuring quick and efficient travel to both Dublin and Belfast.\n\nwww.glenbrook.ie"
      },
      {
